type: dataset
title: "Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023: sections, IPC correspondence and classification"
abstract: "The Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023 in English as enacted, one row per section; the Indian Penal Code provisions the government's table lists against each section; and the classification of offences from the First Schedule of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023. The Act came into force on 1 July 2024, except section 106(2)."
